  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:86093",
  "description": "The golang packages provide the Go programming language compiler.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * net/[http:](http:) golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n  * crypto/tls: golang: crypto/tls: Denial of Service via multiple ECH outer extension references (CVE-2026-97031)\n  * net/[http:](http:) net/http/internal/http2: golang.org/x/net/http2: net/[http:](http:) Denial of Service via excessive HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames (CVE-2026-78669)\n  * golang: crypto/x509: Go: crypto/x509: mitigation for security concerns with a specific Certificate Authority (CVE-2026-111943)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update Go to version 1.26.10+1 [almalinux-10.2.z] (JIRA:AlmaLinux-287191)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
